WEBVTT

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.156
birinchi harfdir.

00:02:02.156 --> 00:02:03.950
Bu so'z "nimadir" degan ma'noni,

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.798
xuddi biz tushunadigan so'zni,

00:02:05.798 --> 00:02:09.084
qandaydir aniq bo'lmagan narsani 
anglatadi.

00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:10.249
Arab tilida

00:02:10.249 --> 00:02:11.450
uni aniq qilish mumkin,

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:13.598
'al' artiklini qo'shish orqali.

00:02:13.598 --> 00:02:16.200
Bu bilan 'al-shayun' —

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.850
"bu noaniq narsa".

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:21.153
Bu so'z XX asrda, ildizni hisoblash kabi

00:02:21.153 --> 00:02:28.353
dastlabki matematik hisoblashlarda 
uchraydi.

00:02:28.353 --> 00:02:30.863
O'rta asrlarda bu materialni tarjima 
qilayotgan